158 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (RS Verona 2026 will be the first EYP event ever hosted in Verona, and we aim to expand our network in the city, as we believe it plays a key role in the national landscape \(industrially, culturally, logistically, and historically\). We would therefore love to build meaningful connections in the city with you, and it is our utmost pleasure to welcome you to Verona, where we look forward to sharing this amazing and long-lasting journey together.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
