<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (We are Dorian and Pau, the co-presidents of this session. Together with our academic team, we are doing our very best to make this event impactful, meaningful, and unforgettable for everyone involved. We hope you are excited about the upcoming session and that you will enjoy the academic side of it as much as we do \(in other words, a lot!\))
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
171 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (Academics are here to help you understand Europe and EYP a little better. You will dive into important topics and explore how European policies and different stakeholders shape our societies. With the support of your chairpersons, you will discuss these challenges, exchange ideas, and work together to propose solutions. In a way, this is where you start shaping the Europe you want to see.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
