/E (I am Claudia Cacciola \(she/her\) one of the Event Safe People \(ESPs\) of Verona RSC. As you read this I hope you are excited for Verona RSC, a place to debate important topics and meet new people. Our job is to ensure that Verona RSc is a safe space for all participants, and ensure everyone's physical and mental well-being is looked after. This means we are here for any emergencies regarding your well-being or routine things you might need help with!)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
