/P 108 0 R
/E (The first stage of the session focuses on team building activities. Through exercises based on communication, empathy, and cooperation, participants are encouraged to get to know one another and develop strong group dynamics. The objective is to create international teams capable of working together effectively in order to produce a high-quality collective outcome.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
