>>
endobj
263 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (The second phase is dedicated to committee work. During this part of the event, delegates discuss the selected topic in depth and cooperate to draft a common resolution. Guided by the chairperson, participants engage in peer learning, critical thinking, negotiation, and debate, aiming to reach shared decisions through discussion and consensus.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
