/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
265 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 108 0 R
/E (The session concludes with the General Assembly, which simulates the procedures of the European Parliament. In this final stage, committees present and defend their resolutions before all participants. The debate includes speeches, questions from the audience, and a final vote that determines whether each proposal is accepted or rejected.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
